    <preface>
      <p>Treasury Laws Amendment (2017 Measures No. 1) Act 2017</p>
      <p>No. 26, 2017</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to taxation, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments to innovation measures	3</p>
      <p>Income Tax Assessment Act 1997	3</p>
